<h1>About OnlinePDFPro</h1>
<p>OnlinePDFPro is a PDF and document productivity platform for people who need practical tools without a complicated desktop workflow. The site combines free browser-based utilities with a small collection of downloadable study materials.</p>
<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>Make common document tasks fast, understandable, and accessible. The free PDF tools do not require an account, and each tool page explains its supported formats, limits, and processing method.</p>
<h2>Our Tools</h2>
<p>OnlinePDFPro includes tools for merging, compressing, splitting, signing, converting, organizing, reading, and extracting text from PDFs, plus selected document utilities. Many tools run in the browser; tools that use external AI, OCR, or conversion services identify that before processing.</p>
<h2>Study Materials</h2>
<p>Study materials are digital PDFs prepared for students and independent learners. Product pages describe what is included, the page count, price, and any AI-assisted preparation. Purchased materials are available again from <a href="/library.html">My Library</a>.</p>
<h2>Privacy First</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. Files processed in the browser stay on your device, while server or API processing is disclosed on the relevant tool page. Account and purchase data are used to provide authentication, support, and library access.</p>
<h2>Who Maintains OnlinePDFPro</h2>
<p>OnlinePDFPro is maintained as an independent project. Questions, corrections, accessibility feedback, and support requests can be sent to <a href="mailto:support@onlinepdfpro.com">support@onlinepdfpro.com</a>.</p>
